# `/tokens.md` and `/keys.md` are the no-JS mirrors of the key door (#223).
#
# Pages cannot be relied on to infer markdown from these paths, and a curl-only
# agent that receives `text/html` has nothing it knows how to read. Pin the
# type on each file rather than on a splat, so a future `.md` elsewhere is a
# deliberate choice.
/tokens.md
	Content-Type: text/markdown; charset=utf-8

/keys.md
	Content-Type: text/markdown; charset=utf-8
